            "Mounted at /content/drive\n",
            "/content/drive/MyDrive/09-PEM-Assignment\n",
            "\n",
            "Annual totals, kilograms of carbon per square metre per year\n",
            "==============================================================================\n",
            "Biome                                GPP    Maint.    Growth       NPP  NPP/GPP\n",
            "------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
            "Evergreen broadleaf forest        2.2979    1.4310    0.1332    0.7338     0.32\n",
            "Open shrubland                    0.2846    0.2178    0.0094    0.0574     0.20\n",
            "Cropland                          0.5457    0.1079    0.0270    0.4108     0.75\n",
            "==============================================================================\n",
            "\n",
            "Maint. is maintenance respiration, Growth is growth respiration.\n",
            "NPP = GPP - (maintenance + growth).\n",
            "\n",
            "Wrote /content/drive/MyDrive/09-PEM-Assignment/output/annual_summary.csv\n",
            "Wrote /content/drive/MyDrive/09-PEM-Assignment/output/site_02_evergreen_broadleaf_forest_daily.csv\n",
            "Wrote /content/drive/MyDrive/09-PEM-Assignment/output/site_09_open_shrubland_daily.csv\n",
            "Wrote /content/drive/MyDrive/09-PEM-Assignment/output/site_11_cropland_daily.csv\n",
            "\n",
            "Wrote four figures into the output folder:\n",
            "  /content/drive/MyDrive/09-PEM-Assignment/output/fig1_daily_gpp.png\n",
            "  /content/drive/MyDrive/09-PEM-Assignment/output/fig2_daily_npp.png\n",
            "  /content/drive/MyDrive/09-PEM-Assignment/output/fig3_efficiency_drivers.png\n",
            "  /content/drive/MyDrive/09-PEM-Assignment/output/fig4_annual_balance.png\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "import pem\n",
        "lut = pem.read_lookup_table('data/lookup_table.tsv')\n",
        "site = pem.read_site('data/site_02_evergreen_broadleaf_forest.txt')\n",
        "out = pem.run_pem(site, lut)\n",
        "print(out['annual_gpp'], out['annual_npp'])"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "collapsed": true,
        "id": "ErzddOZXFSm3",
